 that are hostile to him will shift to Wither.","abilities":["Attacks 2 targets simultaneously","Fires explosive arrows at three targets which explode after a short delay, dealing high Arts damage to the target and surrounding four tiles","Gains greatly increased ATK, ASPD, and Movement Speed when <Corrupted Knight> dies"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":500,"def":600,"res":70,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"body_of_sui":{"slug":"body_of_sui","name":"'Body of Sui'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Body of Sui'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Formed from ink and sculptures, It hides in the clouds, waiting for the opportunity to extinguish the candle of mankind.","abilities":["Does not normally exist on the battlefield; locks on to your unit with the most nearby units, triggering [Sleepless]","[Sleepless] Forces the target and Operators in the 8 surrounding tiles to retreat, temporarily creating undeployable for a while","Triggers [Sleepless] and stays on the battlefield for a while before leaving without draining Life Points"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":240000,"atk":800,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}}},"dropIcons":{},"previewFile":"ro5_sv_7_dlc1.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":3,"description":"Attacks the enemy with the highest Max HP first","hidden":false,"key":"trap_014_tower","kind":"device","name":"L-44 'Gramophone'","row":3},{"col":8,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_037_airsup","kind":"device","name":"Mobile Tactical Hangar","row":4},{"col":0,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_251_buftrp","kind":"device","name":"Artifact Center","row":0}],"playbackPaths":{"1":{"points":[[4,3],[5,3],[6,3],[6,2],[6,1],[6,0]],"d